        348.59,
        510.51,
        428.58,
        75.56,
        428.58
      ],
      "text": "माननीय सर्वोच्च न्यायालय द्वारा विषयांकित प्रकरण में hate speech\nand hate crimes के संबंध में दिशा निर्देश दिए गए हैं, जो संदर्भित परिपत्र दिनांक\n17.05.2023 के माध्यम से पालन हेतु पूर्व में प्रेषित किए गए हैं।"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 12,
      "poly": [
        75.56,
        421.84,
        514.08,
        421.84,
        514.08,
        500.99,
        75.56,
        500.99
      ],
      "text": "माननीय सर्वोच्च न्यायालय द्वारा डब्ल्यू.पी. (सिविल) क्रमांक-\n943/2021 अश्वनी कुमार उपाध्याय विरूद्ध यूनियन ऑफ इण्डिया में दिनांक\n28.04.2023 को जारी निर्देश निम्नानुसार है :"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 13,
      "poly": [
        67.83,
        498.46,
        520.62,
        498.46,
        520.62,
        624.76,
        67.83,
        624.76
      ],
      "text": "Respondent Nos.9 to 36 will therefore issue direction(s) to their\nsubordinates so that appropriate action in law will be taken at the earliest. We\nmake it clear that any hesitation to act in accordance with this direction will be\nviewed as contempt of this Court and appropriate action will be taken against\nthe erring officers."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 14,
      "poly": [
        69.62,
        632.34,
        523.6,
        632.34,
        523.6,
        737.59,
        69.62,
        737.59
      ],
      "text": "We further make it clear that such action will be taken irrespective\nof the religion that the maker of the speech or the person who commits such\nact may profess, so that the secular character of India, that is, Bharat as is\nenvisaged by the Preamble, is preserved and protected."
    },
